Package: rcs
Title: Catalog-First Cloud and Local Storage of Tabular and Geospatial Data
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R:
    person("Eduard", "Bukin", , "edwardbukin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Stores tabular, geospatial vector and raster data in one store
    that is kept in a primary location and any number of secondary ones,
    local folders or cloud buckets, mainly as 'Parquet' files. Every
    operation starts from the catalog of the store: datasets are inspected,
    streamed, sampled and written through it, and every write lands in all
    locations with verified checksums.
